WEBVTT

00:01:39.120 --> 00:01:40.720
Independent Brigade is in charge of city defense.

00:01:41.600 --> 00:01:43.880
If we want to do anti-Japanese activities in Shaanxi,

00:01:44.120 --> 00:01:45.280
we have to deal with him.

00:01:47.160 --> 00:01:48.920
He's a tough bone.

00:01:49.240 --> 00:01:51.520
It's not easy to persuade him.

00:01:52.400 --> 00:01:54.320
I'll stay and do his work alone.

00:01:54.520 --> 00:01:55.440
Okay.

00:01:55.640 --> 00:01:57.520
Before you can understand his mind,

00:01:57.920 --> 00:01:59.160
I'll go around him.

00:02:02.640 --> 00:02:05.960
I heard Chae Jin

00:02:06.200 --> 00:02:07.440
by Chae Jin.

00:02:07.800 --> 00:02:09.280
Is this true?

00:02:09.479 --> 00:02:10.639
I've asked around.

00:02:10.840 --> 00:02:11.880
It's true.

00:02:14.080 --> 00:02:16.720
Cui Wenkui is always meticulous.

00:02:21.600 --> 00:02:23.840
How did he offend Cai Zhen?

00:02:24.079 --> 00:02:27.720
It is said that Chae Jin suspected that he was reduced by the Communist Party.

00:02:28.680 --> 00:02:30.360
Cui Wenkui was annihilated by the Communist Party.

00:02:34.840 --> 00:02:37.160
Cui Wenkui hates the accomplice.

00:02:37.360 --> 00:02:39.040
He caught the accomplice spy himself.

00:02:39.320 --> 00:02:41.560
He caught more than the other groups.

00:02:41.760 --> 00:02:44.360
Who would believe that?

00:02:45.600 --> 00:02:46.520
Master,

00:02:47.200 --> 00:02:49.079
Are you going to bail him out?

00:02:50.240 --> 00:02:51.240
No.

00:02:54.400 --> 00:02:57.120
Cui Wenkui is known as General Tie.

00:02:57.880 --> 00:03:00.000
I couldn't find anything on him.

00:03:01.520 --> 00:03:04.520
His independent Brigade

00:03:04.520 --> 00:03:06.160
under my nose.

00:03:06.800 --> 00:03:08.880
It's his turn to be unlucky.

00:03:09.560 --> 00:03:10.640
Master,

00:03:11.400 --> 00:03:14.080
Are you interested in his independent Brigade?

00:03:16.920 --> 00:03:17.880
Yes.

00:03:21.040 --> 00:03:22.079
His independent Brigade

00:03:24.240 --> 00:03:26.360
Since he resists the Japanese now,

00:03:26.720 --> 00:03:29.640
so he is temporarily cooperating with our 16th Division.

00:03:29.720 --> 00:03:30.600
But he doesn’t

00:03:30.720 --> 00:03:33.000
regard himself as the 16th Master.

00:03:33.200 --> 00:03:34.720
I always wanted to swallow him.

00:03:35.160 --> 00:03:36.840
but I couldn't find a chance.

00:03:37.079 --> 00:03:38.160
Master.

00:03:38.320 --> 00:03:39.320
Cai Zhen

00:03:39.560 --> 00:03:41.560
helped you a lot.

00:03:44.440 --> 00:03:45.480
Not enough.

00:03:46.000 --> 00:03:48.360
If Choi Moon-Kui gets out of prison,

00:03:48.720 --> 00:03:49.960
it's my nephew who lit the lantern.

00:03:50.160 --> 00:03:51.280
Everything is the same.

00:03:57.120 --> 00:03:59.840
We have to prove Cui Wenkui's crime

00:04:00.520 --> 00:04:04.280
the independent Brigade is our treasure.

00:04:04.680 --> 00:04:05.600
Wonderful.

00:04:05.800 --> 00:04:07.400
Good idea, Master.

00:04:08.400 --> 00:04:09.520
Independent Brigade

00:04:09.520 --> 00:04:11.840
is one third of the team.

00:04:12.400 --> 00:04:15.560
How much pay should we get?

00:04:16.760 --> 00:04:20.079
When the time comes,

00:04:20.320 --> 00:04:21.440
and logistics

00:04:21.880 --> 00:04:25.120
will all fall into our pockets.

00:04:33.880 --> 00:04:34.880
Come in.

00:04:36.600 --> 00:04:37.760
How's your injury?

00:04:38.360 --> 00:04:39.200
Nothing serious.

00:04:39.360 --> 00:04:40.320
It's just a scratch.

00:04:40.560 --> 00:04:42.280
Thank you for sending me to the hospital.

00:04:42.880 --> 00:04:44.400
I should thank you.

00:04:44.680 --> 00:04:46.080
You saved the people

00:04:46.360 --> 00:04:48.159
to save the people from a disaster.

00:04:49.000 --> 00:04:50.200
No need to be polite.

00:04:50.480 --> 00:04:52.360
I just did what I should.

00:04:52.720 --> 00:04:54.880
Please keep your promise.

00:04:55.920 --> 00:04:56.880
Of course.

00:05:34.760 --> 00:05:37.440
I brought you your favorite food.

00:05:52.640 --> 00:05:53.480
Eat.

00:06:03.440 --> 00:06:04.400
Do you remember this?

00:06:18.040 --> 00:06:18.880
Tell me.

00:06:19.400 --> 00:06:20.480
Have you suffered a lot

00:06:20.480 --> 00:06:21.720
have you suffered a lot?

00:06:27.640 --> 00:06:28.400
No.

00:06:29.000 --> 00:06:29.880
No.

00:06:35.120 --> 00:06:38.120
I guess you took the buns out.

00:06:39.040 --> 00:06:40.080
Stop it.

00:06:40.800 --> 00:06:42.240
Get me out of here.

00:06:43.720 --> 00:06:44.960
When Bao leaves the city,

00:06:45.400 --> 00:06:46.640
I'll let you out right away.

00:06:54.240 --> 00:06:55.280
I've been like this since I was a kid.

00:06:56.320 --> 00:06:57.120
I fought with him.

00:06:57.120 --> 00:06:58.200
You've been siding with him.

00:06:59.520 --> 00:07:01.120
Am I your brother?

00:07:02.000 --> 00:07:02.960
Of course.

00:07:03.320 --> 00:07:04.320
Brother.

00:07:05.880 --> 00:07:08.200
Then why do you always side with others?

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:25.360
Ni, you're so pretty.

00:07:25.400 --> 00:07:26.640
I think of you every day.

00:07:28.280 --> 00:07:29.120
What are you doing?

00:07:29.320 --> 00:07:30.120
Let go of me!

00:07:30.320 --> 00:07:31.160
Help!

00:07:31.440 --> 00:07:32.560
Stop yelling.

00:07:32.760 --> 00:07:33.800
Don't say there's no one here.

00:07:34.560 --> 00:07:35.480
Even if there are people,

00:07:35.760 --> 00:07:36.960
I won’t be afraid of them.

00:07:37.720 --> 00:07:39.480
Because Qinglong Fortress

00:07:39.920 --> 00:07:41.480
will be mine soon.

00:07:42.120 --> 00:07:43.080
Are you crazy?

00:07:43.200 --> 00:07:44.840
How could Qinglong Camp be yours?

00:07:45.000 --> 00:07:45.840
This place

00:07:46.159 --> 00:07:48.240
will soon be occupied by us Japanese.

00:07:48.800 --> 00:07:51.600
Qinglong Camp, Shanzhou City,

00:07:51.800 --> 00:07:53.000
and these three levels

00:07:53.480 --> 00:07:54.560
will fall into

00:07:54.560 --> 00:07:56.720
in our hands.

00:07:57.240 --> 00:07:58.560
You are Japanese.

00:07:59.840 --> 00:08:01.080
Help! Japanese!

00:08:01.240 --> 00:08:02.320
Help! Shut up!

00:08:02.520 --> 00:08:04.280
You know what will happen to Er Dan.

00:08:04.480 --> 00:08:06.520
If you keep screaming, you'll end up like him.

00:08:08.800 --> 00:08:10.320
You killed Erdan!

00:08:11.320 --> 00:08:12.320
You bastard!

00:08:12.520 --> 00:08:15.760
That's right.

00:08:16.000 --> 00:08:18.680
Ni, I really like you.

00:08:18.880 --> 00:08:20.560
As long as you follow me,

00:08:20.800 --> 00:08:23.640
we will treat you well.

00:08:23.960 --> 00:08:26.160
You will have endless glory and wealth.

00:08:27.000 --> 00:08:28.400
I don't want any wealth.

00:08:29.200 --> 00:08:29.960
Let go of me!

00:08:30.160 --> 00:08:31.240
Help! Don't scream!

00:08:31.440 --> 00:08:32.200
Help!

00:08:32.400 --> 00:08:34.080
No one will save you here.

00:08:34.840 --> 00:08:37.480
You belong to me today.

00:08:40.240 --> 00:08:41.120
Help!

00:08:41.440 --> 00:08:42.360
Move!

00:08:42.679 --> 00:08:43.640
Stop!

00:08:48.480 --> 00:08:50.600
Who said no one can save her?

00:08:52.240 --> 00:08:53.600
Uncle Liu, save me!

00:08:53.600 --> 00:08:54.840
He's Japanese.

00:08:55.360 --> 00:08:56.680
I've been looking for him for so long.

00:08:57.640 --> 00:08:59.800
I didn't expect the biggest spy

00:09:00.120 --> 00:09:02.240
is hiding beside me.

00:09:02.680 --> 00:09:05.200
That's right.

00:09:05.880 --> 00:09:07.080
It's been four years.

00:09:07.880 --> 00:09:09.640
you haven't noticed me.

00:09:10.240 --> 00:09:12.120
That's because you're too stupid.

00:09:12.560 --> 00:09:15.120
Do you know what I represent?

00:09:15.880 --> 00:09:17.200
Ghost!

00:09:17.480 --> 00:09:20.160
If I didn't keep you alive,

00:09:21.360 --> 00:09:23.040
I would have killed you that day.

00:09:23.440 --> 00:09:25.440
You can kill me now.

00:09:26.520 --> 00:09:27.680
You bastard!

00:09:38.240 --> 00:09:40.200
You ghost!

00:09:40.600 --> 00:09:43.000
You were the one who attacked me that night.

00:09:43.320 --> 00:09:45.480
I didn't kill you that night.

00:09:46.000 --> 00:09:47.560
What a pity.

00:09:47.920 --> 00:09:49.760
You ruined my plan.

00:09:49.840 --> 00:09:51.080
I'll kill you.

00:09:51.680 --> 00:09:54.120
You killed so many of our men.

00:09:54.800 --> 00:09:58.200
I'm going to kill them today.

00:09:58.400 --> 00:09:59.600
and see who dies fast.

00:10:10.720 --> 00:10:12.440
I'll kill you today.

00:10:19.280 --> 00:10:21.080
Kid, your foot-repair knife

00:10:21.280 --> 00:10:23.160
is not enough to tickle me.

00:10:23.480 --> 00:10:25.640
Go report to hell.

00:10:40.120 --> 00:10:41.080
Good.

00:10:43.880 --> 00:10:45.240
Uncle Liu, are you okay?

00:10:45.560 --> 00:10:46.560
I'm fine.

00:10:56.720 --> 00:10:57.600
Here.

00:10:58.920 --> 00:10:59.760
Baoni.

00:11:00.400 --> 00:11:01.240
It's okay.

00:11:01.480 --> 00:11:02.320
Go home.

00:11:14.600 --> 00:11:15.520
Be careful.

00:11:26.440 --> 00:11:27.520
What are you doing?

00:11:27.760 --> 00:11:28.840
Which unit are you from?

00:11:49.800 --> 00:11:51.520
I'm Master 16, Jang Gong-yeon.

00:11:53.640 --> 00:11:55.440
From today onwards,

00:11:55.760 --> 00:11:57.280
from today on.

00:12:02.720 --> 00:12:03.520
Brother.

00:12:03.800 --> 00:12:05.320
Is Jang Gong-yeon here?

00:12:05.520 --> 00:12:06.480
You'll know soon.

00:12:16.720 --> 00:12:17.760
Brigade Commander Cui.

00:12:20.120 --> 00:12:23.120
Brigade Commander Cui, we meet again.

00:12:26.800 --> 00:12:30.000
But this place is too special.

00:12:30.240 --> 00:12:31.720
I knew it was you.

00:12:32.640 --> 00:12:33.680
What do you mean?

00:12:33.920 --> 00:12:36.760
I heard that Brigadier Cui who guarded Shanzhou

00:12:36.960 --> 00:12:38.400
is suspected of collaboration.

00:12:39.120 --> 00:12:41.960
As the commander of the frontline of Yu Xi,

00:12:42.280 --> 00:12:43.840
I have to investigate it.

00:12:44.040 --> 00:12:46.560
Mr. Zhang, you’re a Division Commander.

00:12:46.760 --> 00:12:48.280
Can you use your brain?

00:12:48.920 --> 00:12:50.360
It's nothing.

00:12:50.360 --> 00:12:51.520
You believe it too?

00:12:54.440 --> 00:12:57.560
I heard Brigade Commander Cui is called General Tie.

00:12:57.800 --> 00:12:59.480
When you're in this cell today,

00:13:01.160 --> 00:13:02.840
Are you sure you're fine?

00:13:03.400 --> 00:13:05.680
How can you be sure that I'm not okay?

00:13:06.000 --> 00:13:08.240
Brigade Commander Cui is in an important position.

00:13:08.480 --> 00:13:10.800
It concerns the stability of the army in Shanzhou.

00:13:11.040 --> 00:13:12.480
If we don't find out the truth,

00:13:12.760 --> 00:13:15.360
I’m afraid the overall situation

00:13:15.680 --> 00:13:17.280
will be affected.

00:13:17.520 --> 00:13:18.960
Investigate it. How?

00:13:20.600 --> 00:13:23.080
What do you mean? Punish me?

00:13:26.080 --> 00:13:28.120
Brigade Commander Cui, I advise you

00:13:28.520 --> 00:13:29.960
you'd better confess honestly.

00:13:30.160 --> 00:13:32.160
your crime of colluding with the rebels.

00:13:33.440 --> 00:13:35.720
Mr. Zhang will definitely

00:13:35.760 --> 00:13:37.080
for your hard work,

00:13:37.320 --> 00:13:40.400
I will put in a good word for you in front of my superior

00:13:41.080 --> 00:13:42.600
and punish you lightly.

00:13:43.480 --> 00:13:44.120
Jang Gong-yeon.

00:13:44.600 --> 00:13:46.720
I know you’re trying to set me up.

00:13:47.200 --> 00:13:49.200
You hit me when I was being investigated.

00:13:49.200 --> 00:13:51.400
and take away my military power from me, right?

00:13:54.040 --> 00:13:55.120
Brigade Commander Cui,

00:13:55.440 --> 00:13:56.640
We are both smart people.

00:13:56.880 --> 00:13:59.400
Why are you being so harsh?

00:13:59.960 --> 00:14:02.680
Your army, my army,

00:14:02.840 --> 00:14:04.960
That's the Party's team.

00:14:05.160 --> 00:14:06.560
It doesn't matter who leads them.

00:14:06.760 --> 00:14:07.840
Jang Gong-yeon.

00:14:08.360 --> 00:14:11.360
I saved your life from the swordsman many times.

00:14:11.640 --> 00:14:13.400
You're so evil.

00:14:13.720 --> 00:14:15.680
Have you lost your conscience?

00:14:17.120 --> 00:14:19.600
Brigade Commander Cui, calm down.

00:14:20.800 --> 00:14:23.080
Actually, there is another way.

00:14:23.320 --> 00:14:25.800
I wonder if Brigade Commander Cui is willing.

00:14:27.040 --> 00:14:29.600
If you give your military power

00:14:29.720 --> 00:14:31.120
to the 16th Division,

00:14:31.680 --> 00:14:34.120
to transfer all weapons, military supplies

00:14:34.320 --> 00:14:37.640
and military supplies.

00:14:37.840 --> 00:14:41.000
I believe he will do everything he can

00:14:41.200 --> 00:14:42.840
to clear your name.

00:14:44.720 --> 00:14:47.440
Are you dreaming in broad daylight?

00:14:49.160 --> 00:14:51.560
Jang Gong-yeon, let me tell you.

00:14:51.560 --> 00:14:53.480
I know you want to expand your team.

00:14:53.760 --> 00:14:56.080
I'm not against that.

00:14:56.320 --> 00:14:58.160
But you're too evil.

00:14:58.400 --> 00:15:00.560
You want to drink blood of soldiers and eat meat.

00:15:00.720 --> 00:15:02.720
and oppressed the soldiers' pay.

00:15:02.920 --> 00:15:05.400
Do you know how hard our brothers are working on the front line?

00:15:05.560 --> 00:15:07.920
How can you let them down?

00:15:11.000 --> 00:15:12.080
Choi Moon-Kui!

00:15:12.680 --> 00:15:15.480
Don't be so hard on me.

00:15:15.880 --> 00:15:17.440
Since we've broken up,

00:15:17.800 --> 00:15:19.800
I won't hide it from you.

00:15:20.600 --> 00:15:22.240
If you don't confess,

00:15:22.520 --> 00:15:24.560
you can’t leave here alive.

00:15:32.560 --> 00:15:33.560
Master.

00:15:34.200 --> 00:15:38.000
Cui Wenkui is the Brigade Commander appointed by the war zone.

00:15:38.280 --> 00:15:39.920
If we go too far,

00:15:40.160 --> 00:15:41.840
if we go too far?

00:15:42.520 --> 00:15:43.640
It's okay.

00:15:44.040 --> 00:15:45.760
As long as he signs and signs,

00:15:46.040 --> 00:15:47.600
there's nothing to say about the war zone commander.

00:15:51.080 --> 00:15:51.920
Why is he

00:15:51.920 --> 00:15:53.400
just like his father?

00:15:53.760 --> 00:15:55.680
The stone in the toilet is stinky and hard.

00:15:56.680 --> 00:15:58.840
How dare you block my way of making money?

00:16:01.360 --> 00:16:02.480
Leave it to me.

00:16:06.400 --> 00:16:07.720
Are you done discussing?

00:16:07.720 --> 00:16:09.040
Hurry up if you want to fight.

00:16:13.840 --> 00:16:14.920
Brigade Commander Cui.

00:16:15.480 --> 00:16:16.840
Hurry up.

00:16:18.280 --> 00:16:22.000
Brigade Commander Cui, I'm sorry.

00:16:31.120 --> 00:16:31.920
Comfortable.

00:16:37.320 --> 00:16:38.320
As promised,

00:16:39.120 --> 00:16:41.600
our swordsmen have left Shanzhou.

00:16:42.080 --> 00:16:43.040
Thank you.

00:16:44.240 --> 00:16:46.320
I don't know if I should say this.

00:16:46.520 --> 00:16:47.640
Just say it.

00:16:48.600 --> 00:16:51.120
Cai has visited you in Shanzhou.

00:16:52.200 --> 00:16:54.400
But she was taken away

00:16:54.600 --> 00:16:56.200
before I got to the hospital.

00:16:56.560 --> 00:16:58.120
But I saved him.

00:16:58.360 --> 00:17:00.240
Send someone back for treatment.

00:17:01.440 --> 00:17:02.640
Miss Shangguan.

00:17:03.560 --> 00:17:04.680
I can see

00:17:04.760 --> 00:17:06.680
Jennifer Cai loves you so much.

00:17:07.280 --> 00:17:09.040
She misses you all the time.

00:17:09.680 --> 00:17:11.400
How could he do something that makes you sad?

00:17:13.240 --> 00:17:14.400
Tell him this.

00:17:15.520 --> 00:17:16.800
Don't show up in front of me.

00:17:17.520 --> 00:17:19.240
Or I'll kill him.

00:17:31.560 --> 00:17:33.280
Wen Pei. Wen Pei.

00:17:33.720 --> 00:17:36.200
I heard a news on my way back.

00:17:36.480 --> 00:17:38.680
Jang Gong-yeon controls the independent Brigade Headquarters.

00:17:39.040 --> 00:17:41.080
and interrogated Choi Moon-Kui in prison.

00:17:41.600 --> 00:17:43.520
Jang Gong-yeon, that bastard.

00:17:44.560 --> 00:17:45.640
I have to go back to save him.

00:17:46.840 --> 00:17:47.600
Wait for me.

00:18:04.520 --> 00:18:08.040
Master, this kid is really tough.

00:18:08.320 --> 00:18:09.760
He broke several sticks.

00:18:10.560 --> 00:18:11.720
but they won't let go.

00:18:18.240 --> 00:18:19.960
The Cui family is all like this.

00:18:20.520 --> 00:18:22.520
If it was so easy,

00:18:22.920 --> 00:18:24.960
I wouldn't have been so troublesome back then.

00:18:25.120 --> 00:18:26.120
You won't let go?

00:18:28.440 --> 00:18:29.400
Fine.

00:18:38.480 --> 00:18:42.480
Let's try something else.

00:18:44.640 --> 00:18:45.640
Stop!

00:18:56.680 --> 00:18:58.520
Who allowed you to abuse your private torture here?

00:18:58.720 --> 00:19:00.640
You caught him, Major Chae.

00:19:00.840 --> 00:19:02.560
He's charged with treason.

00:19:02.960 --> 00:19:04.960
Chief Lu and I are interrogating him.

00:19:05.680 --> 00:19:06.840
Any questions?

00:19:07.840 --> 00:19:10.120
This is the prisoner of our army.

00:19:11.880 --> 00:19:13.320
If you want to ask,

00:19:13.680 --> 00:19:14.800
I’ll give you a detailed report

00:19:14.880 --> 00:19:16.480
after the investigation.

00:19:16.800 --> 00:19:19.040
But if you interfere with our interrogation,

00:19:19.680 --> 00:19:21.840
your arms are too long.

00:19:25.560 --> 00:19:27.840
We're just helping.

00:19:28.240 --> 00:19:30.680
I'm afraid you'll overwork yourself.

00:19:30.680 --> 00:19:31.600
No need.

00:19:31.960 --> 00:19:34.360
Agent investigation is our duty.

00:19:34.680 --> 00:19:37.240
If you are interested in taking this case,

00:19:37.680 --> 00:19:39.960
you can say hello to Mr. Dai.

00:19:40.800 --> 00:19:44.960
I will hand over the case.

00:19:51.000 --> 00:19:51.960
Master.

00:19:52.360 --> 00:19:53.400
Mr. Dai

00:19:53.600 --> 00:19:55.920
is a living hell who eats people without spitting bones.

00:19:56.240 --> 00:19:57.640
He doesn't seem to have a high rank,

